    reality: 'One pipeline that actually moves and transforms real data end to end — not a course exercise — is consistently what moves a candidate out of the services-floor range and into this band.',
  },
  {
    stage: 'Fresher, top institute into a product company or GCC',
    range: 'Rs 14-20 LPA, some offers Rs 20-28 LPA',
    reality: 'Reserved for a smaller slice of graduates combining a strong CS foundation with a genuine, explainable systems project — GCC and product-company data platform teams filter hard on this.',
  },
  {
    stage: 'Mid-level, 3-5 years, services or analytics firm',
